scene U: {N} wants to know what {rival} has that {N} does not, and whether it can be learned.
scene B: {rival} is good, and the leaders like a fresh face. {N} has been taken for granted, and knows it.
scene R: {N} sits through the announcement with a polite face and a burning chest.
