works: The leaders think again, and {N} gets a turn after all.
fails: The rift with {rival} hardens, and the group starts to feel like two camps.
fails: Nothing changes, and {N} spends the season on the edge of things.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- senior: the old guard against new ways (calls UG, s3)

== the newer members want to change how it is done
tier: everyday
