- U>G | write down the group's story before the old ways are gone | v: tradition | chance: 80
- B>W | quietly fill the next meeting with old hands to block it | v: power, tradition | closed: approval: rigging a meeting; backfire: the newer members find out and leave | chance: 65
- R>U | go along to one of the newcomers' own gatherings and see what they love | door | v: stimulation, universalism | chance: 78
