- U>R | plan a surprise trip to somewhere neither of you has ever been | v: stimulation | chance: 80
- B>G | put your savings together into a home of your own | binds | v: security | title: homeowner | chance: 60
- R>W | tell your partner the truth: that you miss them, and you are scared | v: benevolence | chance: 75
- G>U | ask the couple you most admire how they got through their quiet years | v: tradition, self-direction | chance: 80
works: Something warms again between them, slowly, the way a house warms after the heating comes back on.
works: {partner} turns out to have felt the same, and was waiting for {N} to say it.
fails: The quiet goes on, and both of them get better at living around each other.
fails: Something said in frustration lands harder than meant, and a hard week follows.

